const policies={privacy:['Privacy Policy','Your information, thoughtfully handled.',[['Information you share','When you submit an enquiry, we receive your name, email address, selected topic and message. Please avoid sending sensitive personal information.'],['How information is used','Your details are used to review and respond to your request, discuss a potential order or collaboration, and maintain necessary correspondence. The information is not used to send marketing messages without an appropriate basis.'],['Service providers & retention','The website host and configured email service may process enquiry data to deliver the service. Retention periods and the responsible business details must be confirmed by the operator before commercial launch.'],['Your requests','Contact the email shown below to ask about access, correction or deletion of your enquiry data. Applicable rights depend on your location and the operator’s legal obligations.'],['Website storage','This website stores your cookie preference in your browser. No analytics or advertising cookies are included in this version.']]],terms:['Terms & Conditions','A clear starting point.',[['Collection information','This website currently presents styling inspiration and an enquiry catalogue. Images, sample palettes and measuring examples are illustrative. They are not a binding offer or a guarantee of stock.'],['Orders & pricing','There is no online checkout. Product composition, measurements, included items, price, delivery and applicable terms must be confirmed in writing before any order is accepted.'],['Use of the website','You may browse the collections and send genuine enquiries. Do not misuse the form, attempt unauthorized access or submit unlawful content.'],['Images & third-party material','Images may depict inspirational settings and accessories outside the offered range. Reference photography and third-party assets remain subject to their respective licenses.'],['Business information','The operator must add its legal business details and applicable commercial terms before accepting orders. Contact us using the details below for current information.']]],cookies:['Cookie Policy','Small preferences. Clear choices.',[['Essential preference storage','We use localStorage to remember whether you accepted or declined optional cookies. This is stored on your own device under loomelle-consent.'],['Optional cookies','No analytics, advertising or third-party tracking scripts are active in this website version. Accepting optional cookies does not activate any additional tracking.'],['Change your choice','Use Cookie preferences in the footer to reopen the notice. You can also clear site data in your browser settings.']]],'shipping-returns':['Shipping & Returns','Know the details before you order.',[['Delivery destinations','Tell us your delivery country and postcode in your enquiry. We will confirm whether delivery is available to your location.'],['Shipping price & timing','Shipping costs, dispatch estimates and delivery timing are confirmed with your proposal. No fixed delivery promise is made by this preview catalogue.'],['Returns & exchanges','Ask for the applicable return window, eligibility, return address and any return costs before placing an order. Custom-made items may have different conditions, which must be explained before purchase.'],['Damaged or incorrect items','Contact the business promptly with your order reference, a description and photographs where appropriate. We will explain the next steps for your case.'],['Before placing an order','Confirm the product, composition, dimensions, quantity, price, shipping terms and returns policy in writing. Statutory rights remain unaffected.']]]};
